<% content_for :title, "Tooltips" %>

<%= h2_with_anchor "Overview" %>
<p>Tooltips are powered by <%= link_to "Floating UI", "https://floating-ui.com/", target: :_blank %> via the Rails Blocks <code>ui-tooltip</code> Stimulus controller, which you can add anywhere in your application. See also <%= link_to "Clipboard", clipboard_docs_path %> which uses tooltips.</p>
<p>Add a <code>data-controller="ui-tooltip" data-ui-tooltip-content="My tooltip"</code> to the element you want to add the tooltip to. You can set options using data attributes without writing any JS.</p>

<%= render "jumpstart/docs/snippet" do %>
<button class="btn btn-secondary" data-controller="ui-tooltip" data-ui-tooltip-content="I'm a tooltip!">Hover over me</button>
<% end %>

<p>You can also specify the placement of the tooltip with <code>data-ui-tooltip-placement-value="right"</code>.</p>

<%= render "jumpstart/docs/snippet" do %>
  <button class="btn btn-secondary" data-controller="ui-tooltip" data-ui-tooltip-placement-value="right" data-ui-tooltip-content="I'm a tooltip!">Hover over me</button>
<% end %>
